WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.390
Oh my God.
I desperately need to get some Botox.

2
00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:17.100
Well. Xavi can give you Botox. Can't he?

3
00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.228
Ugh. Xavi's been really getting
on my nerves. I swear to God.

4
00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:21.646
What's wrong?

5
00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.941
I'm pretty sure that he's getting hit on
by that trashy girl in class.

6
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.109
Oh God…

7
00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:30.071
And… you know how men are.
They just can't resist. can they?

8
00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.781
But it's no big deal.

9
00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:34.367
I've got a little back-up plan
I'm working on. so…

10
00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:37.871
-But… I mean. you're still together?
-Obviously.

11
00:00:37.954 --> 00:00:40.665
Xavi and I are supposed to be together.

12
00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.001
We can't live without each other.
We're the perfect couple.

13
00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.669
Aww.

14
00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:46.254
Ugh. my wrinkles.

15
00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.008
Oh. Marissa! Look who's here!

16
00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:52.761
-Ugh.
-It's our little vampire queen.

17
00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:54.304
Listen. could we chat for a sec?

18
00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.764
Sure. Samantha.

19
00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:57.766
You know. we admire you a lot.

20
00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:01.686
It's impressive… just how much
you don't seem to care about. uh.

21
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.480
existing in darkness.

22
00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.190
Uh. thanks? I suppose.

23
00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.150
Mm.

24
00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:11.154
Can I leave? Please?

25
00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.947
You're so dark and misunderstood.

26
00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.407
You're the kind of person who gets

27
00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.701
a smidge of admiration
once you're buried in a morgue.

28
00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:17.869
And Samantha thought…

29
00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:20.830
Well. I guess what everybody's thinking…

30
00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.208
It would be amazing
if you killed yourself.

31
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:24.250
Think it over.

32
00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.504
Did you steal that line
from a horror flick? Or…?

33
00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.548
Well. maybe. But don't you think
it's at least kind of a good idea?

34
00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:32.050
Whatever.

35
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.761
Y'know what I think?

36
00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:37.430
You're all moody
'cause you've got a big secret.

37
00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:38.807
Like what?

38
00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.183
Oh. nothing.

39
00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:44.145
I mean. just what happened between you
and your teacher at your old school.

40
00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.815
God. wouldn't it be awful
if everybody found out?

41
00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.234
-Aw!
-Oh c'mon. Don't worry about it.

42
00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:51.277
I'm very discreet.

43
00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:53.113
Buh-bye!

44
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.585
FINAL PROJECT

45
00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:16.803
-Hey. Why are you here?
-The principal wants to talk. so…

46
00:02:18.888 --> 00:02:22.475
-So. what? Did you get detention?
-No. um… not at all.

47
00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:25.019
All right. See ya around.

48
00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.730
Okay. you got me.

49
00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.858
I have to stay
'cause I got in trouble today.

50
00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:31.568
-Because…?
-Because…

51
00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:34.696
I kinda dumped a ton of paint on Samantha.

52
00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.032
Well. I mean.
she probably had it coming. right?

53
00:02:38.116 --> 00:02:41.494
Hey. "a woman has to live her life.
or live to repent not having lived it."

54
00:02:41.578 --> 00:02:42.579
Didn't you know?

55
00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:44.956
"But I do live my life."

56
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:48.376
I didn't think you got to that part.

57
00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:50.044
It's from the beginning of the novel.

58
00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.547
Don't try to pretend we're super close.

59
00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.841
We're two classmates
doing a project together. okay?

60
00:02:55.592 --> 00:02:58.178
Then why'd you bother
to tell me about why you got detention?

61
00:02:58.261 --> 00:02:59.679
Huh?

62
00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:04.309
-Good luck with your match. though.
-Thanks.

63
00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:14.235
Yo. dude.

64
00:03:14.319 --> 00:03:16.571
Can't wait to tell you
about this stream idea.

65
00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:19.073
Oh. really? What's the idea?

66
00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:21.910
Nah. bruh. I can't tell ya.
I can't explain it.

67
00:03:21.993 --> 00:03:23.203
You gotta see it in person.

68
00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:26.581
Okay. Lookin' forward to it.
You're sorta like my manager. Pato.

69
00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.210
No. dude. C'mon. we've talked about this.

70
00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:33.755
I'm not your manager. Xavi.
We're business partners. Okay?

71
00:03:33.838 --> 00:03:36.299
-Got it? You and me are the same.
-Got it. Whatever you say.

72
00:03:39.135 --> 00:03:41.179
Are you still throwing
a party this weekend?

73
00:03:41.262 --> 00:03:42.764
Oh. yeah. This Friday.

74
00:03:42.847 --> 00:03:45.225
-Bet. I'll explain it at the party.
-Okay.

75
00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.972
Let's just say that the vampire

76
00:04:24.055 --> 00:04:25.974
is about to get caught
in the jaw of a wolf.

77
00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:28.226
See ya.

78
00:04:49.414 --> 00:04:50.623
LADY CHATTERLEY'S LOVER

79
00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:00.550
What are you doing here?

80
00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.427
I got detention.

81
00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:05.013
Why? What happened out there?

82
00:05:05.096 --> 00:05:07.140
I got a little revenge on someone.

83
00:05:08.016 --> 00:05:09.434
Revenge on who?

84
00:05:10.893 --> 00:05:11.936
Hey. don't forget.

85
00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.564
we're just two classmates
doing a project together. okay?

86
00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:16.274
You don't need the details.

87
00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:25.825
Here. I got you this.

88
00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.580
For when you go to London.

89
00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:33.207
Javi. you didn't have to.

90
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.752
You think it's cringey. Okay. it's fine.

91
00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:37.170
-No big deal.
-No.

92
00:05:39.881 --> 00:05:41.466
I love it. I promise.

93
00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:45.261
I just… feel a little embarrassed
accepting it.

94
00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:53.186
Uh. so… how long do we stay here?

95
00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.271
Normally. it goes till 5:00.

96
00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:57.774
but sometimes we get
to leave a little before that.

97
00:05:57.857 --> 00:06:00.360
Okay. I'll let my mom know when to get me.

98
00:06:00.443 --> 00:06:02.987
Y'know. if you want.
I'd be more than happy to drive you.

99
00:06:03.071 --> 00:06:04.238
Seriously?

100
00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:06.866
Just say yes.
It's no trouble. really. I have a car.

101
00:06:11.621 --> 00:06:15.124
Hey. Ma? I've got a ride. okay?

102
00:06:27.095 --> 00:06:29.972
That's why I'm trying to move out.
Don't wanna keep living with my parents.

103
00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:31.307
Yeah. I get it.

104
00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:35.311
Sometimes I wish I could move somewhere
super far from here. Really far away.

105
00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:36.437
Yeah.

106
00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:43.027
Well. thank you for driving me. Xavi.
It means a lot to me.

107
00:06:43.111 --> 00:06:44.612
No worries.

108
00:06:44.695 --> 00:06:46.656
-So. see you tomorrow? Or…?
-Mm-hmm.

109
00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.574
Cool.

110
00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:58.042
Tell me. tell me. love

111
00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:01.212
Ooh. what have I done?

112
00:07:01.295 --> 00:07:03.923
Sorry. is this enough…

113
00:07:04.006 --> 00:07:05.007
No. Xavi.

114
00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:06.092
Sorry.

115
00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:09.554
Hold me…

116
00:07:09.637 --> 00:07:10.638
You know what?

117
00:07:11.222 --> 00:07:12.432
I'm not sorry.

118
00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:14.183
I'm not apologizing for that.

119
00:07:15.184 --> 00:07:16.769
Will you hold me?

120
00:07:16.853 --> 00:07:18.980
Your love was strong

121
00:07:19.856 --> 00:07:22.150
Oh. your love was strong

122
00:07:23.526 --> 00:07:26.070
Your love was strong

123
00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:28.656
Xavi. let's stop.

124
00:07:28.739 --> 00:07:31.159
Let's stop and be friends. okay?
Nothing more.

125
00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:33.870
I can't keep hiding how I feel about you.

126
00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:36.497
Are you telling me
you don't feel the same way?

127
00:07:36.581 --> 00:07:37.707
That you don't want this?

128
00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.001
No. I'm not. I have feelings for you.
But I'm a bit…

129
00:07:40.084 --> 00:07:42.962
So what? Why can't we be together. then?

130
00:07:43.045 --> 00:07:44.589
I'm scared about what could happen.

131
00:07:44.672 --> 00:07:47.633
Seriously. you have a girlfriend. Xavi.

132
00:07:47.717 --> 00:07:50.303
I'm nobody. The trashy "Vampire Queen."
according to Samantha.

133
00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.763
Samantha is such a terrible person.

134
00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:54.724
If you hate her that much.
why are you with her?

135
00:07:55.516 --> 00:07:56.851
It's too complicated to explain.

136
00:07:57.977 --> 00:07:59.061
Well.

137
00:08:00.021 --> 00:08:01.689
then this is too complicated.

138
00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:05.902
-Thanks again for driving me. Xavi.
-Tamara! Tamara. please.

139
00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:11.115
Tamara!

140
00:08:50.112 --> 00:08:55.535
Whoa. you're always on my mind

141
00:08:55.618 --> 00:08:59.288
When you've been served a lie

142
00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:02.792
But still. they're number one

143
00:09:05.127 --> 00:09:10.591
I am new to being around

144
00:09:10.675 --> 00:09:14.053
Alone in the crowd

145
00:09:14.136 --> 00:09:20.810
It's you and me tonight

146
00:09:21.852 --> 00:09:25.314
I swear that I don't let go

147
00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:29.819
When you tell me how I told you so

148
00:09:29.902 --> 00:09:32.655
Show me just a new pose

149
00:09:36.659 --> 00:09:40.955
I feel it in your heartbeat

150
00:09:41.038 --> 00:09:44.292
I feel it. I feel it in you

151
00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:47.336
I feel it in your heartbeat

152
00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.090
I feel it in your heartbeat

153
00:09:55.553 --> 00:09:58.598
I feel it in your heartbeat

154
00:10:03.185 --> 00:10:05.354
I feel it in your heartbeat

155
00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:18.451
